---
title: Balance summary request sequence
---
sequenceDiagram
    box rgb(173,216,230) Compute
        participant LegendCompute as Compute
        participant CardServicingUi as Card Servicing UI
        participant ApiGateway as API gateway
        participant CardServicingService as Card Servicing service
        participant CategoryBalanceAggregator as Balance aggregator
    end
    box rgb(144,238,144) Data stores
        participant LegendDataStores as Data stores
        participant AzureManagedRedis as Azure Managed Redis
    end
    box rgb(211,211,211) External systems
        participant LegendExternal as External systems
        participant AuthService as Auth service
        participant ConfigService as Config service
        participant CardDataService as Card Data service
        participant ReferenceDataService as Reference Data
    end
    box rgb(244,204,204) Security
        participant LegendSecurity as Security
        participant AccountAccessGuard as Account access guard
    end
    box rgb(255,255,224) Networking
        participant LegendNetworking as Networking
    end

    CardServicingUi->>ApiGateway: GET balance summary for accountId
    ApiGateway->>CardServicingService: Forward with bearer token
    CardServicingService->>CardServicingService: Start 900 ms deadline and traceId, read held config snapshot
    CardServicingService->>CardServicingService: Validate accountId as 11 digits, not all zero
    break accountId malformed or all zero
        CardServicingService->>CardServicingService: Mark cut-off now,<br/>outcome 400 fixed
        CardServicingService-->>ApiGateway: 400 ErrorObject, no upstream or Config call
        ApiGateway-->>CardServicingUi: 400 INVALID_ARGUMENT
    end

    CardServicingService->>AccountAccessGuard: Check access with bearer token
    break token missing, empty or not Bearer
        AccountAccessGuard->>AccountAccessGuard: Mark cut-off now,<br/>outcome 401 fixed
        AccountAccessGuard-->>CardServicingService: Reject as UNAUTHENTICATED, no Auth call
        CardServicingService-->>ApiGateway: 401 ErrorObject, no Config call
        ApiGateway-->>CardServicingUi: 401 UNAUTHENTICATED
    end
    AccountAccessGuard->>AuthService: ValidateToken
    break token invalid, expired or malformed
        AuthService-->>AccountAccessGuard: UNAUTHENTICATED
        AccountAccessGuard->>AccountAccessGuard: Mark cut-off now,<br/>outcome 401 fixed
        AccountAccessGuard-->>CardServicingService: Reject as UNAUTHENTICATED
        CardServicingService-->>ApiGateway: 401 ErrorObject, no Config call
        ApiGateway-->>CardServicingUi: 401 UNAUTHENTICATED
    end
    break Auth unavailable or deadline spent
        AccountAccessGuard->>AccountAccessGuard: Mark cut-off now,<br/>outcome 503 or 504 fixed
        AccountAccessGuard-->>CardServicingService: Fail closed
        CardServicingService-->>ApiGateway: 503 or 504 ErrorObject, no Config call
        ApiGateway-->>CardServicingUi: 503 UNAVAILABLE or 504 DEADLINE_EXCEEDED
    end
    AuthService-->>AccountAccessGuard: Subject and roles

    AccountAccessGuard->>AuthService: AuthorizeAccountAccess for subject and accountId
    break allowed false
        AuthService-->>AccountAccessGuard: allowed false
        AccountAccessGuard->>AccountAccessGuard: Mark cut-off now,<br/>outcome 403 fixed
        AccountAccessGuard-->>CardServicingService: Deny as PERMISSION_DENIED
        CardServicingService-->>ApiGateway: 403 ErrorObject, no account data read
        ApiGateway-->>CardServicingUi: 403 PERMISSION_DENIED
    end
    break Auth unavailable or deadline spent
        AccountAccessGuard->>AccountAccessGuard: Mark cut-off now,<br/>outcome 503 or 504 fixed
        AccountAccessGuard-->>CardServicingService: Fail closed
        CardServicingService-->>ApiGateway: 503 or 504 ErrorObject, no account data read
        ApiGateway-->>CardServicingUi: 503 UNAVAILABLE or 504 DEADLINE_EXCEEDED
    end
    AuthService-->>AccountAccessGuard: allowed true
    AccountAccessGuard-->>CardServicingService: Access allowed

    opt stale or absent config snapshot
        CardServicingService-)ConfigService: GetConfig background refresh, not awaited
    end

    par account
        CardServicingService->>AzureManagedRedis: Read cached account
        AzureManagedRedis-->>CardServicingService: Fresh entry, stale entry or miss
        CardServicingService->>CardDataService: GetAccount on miss or stale
        CardDataService-->>CardServicingService: Account record
        CardServicingService->>AzureManagedRedis: Store account with cachedAt
    and category balances
        CardServicingService->>AzureManagedRedis: Read cached category balances
        AzureManagedRedis-->>CardServicingService: Fresh entry, stale entry or miss
        CardServicingService->>CardDataService: ListCategoryBalances on miss or stale
        CardDataService-->>CardServicingService: Category balances
        CardServicingService->>AzureManagedRedis: Store category balances with cachedAt
    and transaction types
        CardServicingService->>AzureManagedRedis: Read cached transaction types
        AzureManagedRedis-->>CardServicingService: Fresh entry, stale entry or miss
        CardServicingService->>ReferenceDataService: ListTransactionTypes on miss or stale
        ReferenceDataService-->>CardServicingService: Types with descriptions
        CardServicingService->>AzureManagedRedis: Store transaction types with cachedAt
    end
    CardServicingService->>CategoryBalanceAggregator: Sum balances by type
    CategoryBalanceAggregator-->>CardServicingService: balancesByTypeGroup

    Note over CardServicingService: Cut-off at or before 900 ms

    alt account and balances read, fresh or within 300 s max stale age
        CardServicingService->>CardServicingService: Resolve dataStatus<br/>and asOf
        CardServicingService-->>ApiGateway: 200 balance summary with dataStatus
        ApiGateway-->>CardServicingUi: 200 FRESH, STALE for a stale entry, PARTIAL with null descriptions
    else account unknown
        CardServicingService-->>ApiGateway: 404 ErrorObject
        ApiGateway-->>CardServicingUi: 404 NOT_FOUND
    else account or balances read failed with no usable stale entry
        CardServicingService-->>ApiGateway: 503 or 504 ErrorObject
        ApiGateway-->>CardServicingUi: 503 UNAVAILABLE or 504 DEADLINE_EXCEEDED
    end

    Note over LegendCompute,LegendNetworking: The service validates the account, checks<br/>the token and account access through the<br/>guard, then reads the account, category<br/>balances and transaction types concurrently<br/>through the cache. A stale cache entry<br/>yields STALE, missing types yield PARTIAL<br/>with null descriptions, and the Config<br/>refresh never delays the response.
